graph TB
    subgraph Repo["llm-d-kv-cache (library + sidecar + utility, no operator, no CRDs)"]
        subgraph GoLib["Go indexer library (linked into EPP scheduler, not its own process)"]
            Indexer["pkg/kvcache<br/>Indexer / KVBlockScorer<br/>GetPodScores"]
            KVBlock["pkg/kvcache/kvblock<br/>Index backends: LRU, Ristretto, Redis/Valkey<br/>Token processor: FNV-64a + CBOR"]
            KVEvents["pkg/kvevents<br/>ZeroMQ SUB pool<br/>msgpack decode, FNV-32a shards"]
            Tokenization["pkg/tokenization<br/>UdsTokenizer gRPC client"]
            Telemetry["pkg/telemetry<br/>OTLP/gRPC tracing"]
        end

        subgraph TokImg["Image: odh-llm-d-kv-cache-rhel9"]
            UDSTok["UDS tokenizer sidecar - Python<br/>tokenization.TokenizationService<br/>unix:///tmp/tokenizer/tokenizer-uds.socket<br/>/healthz on 8082/TCP"]
        end

        subgraph EvictImg["Image: odh-llm-d-kv-pvc-evictor-rhel9"]
            Evictor["PVC evictor - Go<br/>Deployment, 1 replica<br/>cleanup 85% / target 70%"]
        end

        PyEvictor["PVC evictor - Python<br/>legacy, not built by Tekton"]
        FSBackend["llmd_fs_backend<br/>vLLM OffloadingConnector FS tier<br/>upstreamed into vLLM"]
        Examples["examples/* + vllm-setup-helm<br/>demo kv-cache-manager :8080<br/>upstream only, not shipped"]
    end

    Indexer -->|tokenize prompt| Tokenization
    Indexer -->|block keys lookup| KVBlock
    KVEvents -->|BlockStored / BlockRemoved| KVBlock
    Indexer -.->|spans| Telemetry
    Tokenization -->|gRPC over UDS| UDSTok

    EPP["llm-d EPP scheduler<br/>precise-prefix-cache-scorer"] -->|imports + calls GetPodScores| Indexer
    KServe["KServe LLMInferenceService controller"] -->|injects sidecar + WithUdsTokenizerConfig| UDSTok
    KServe -.->|configures| EPP

    VLLM["vLLM pods<br/>RHAIIS / llm-d runtime"] -->|KVEvents ZMQ PUB 5557/TCP| KVEvents
    VLLM -->|writes offloaded .bin blocks| PVC[("Shared KV-cache PVC<br/>/kv-cache")]
    FSBackend -.->|runs inside| VLLM
    Evictor -->|statfs, stat atime, unlink| PVC
    Evictor -.->|optional BlockRemoved ZMQ PUB| KVEvents

    UDSTok -->|HTTPS 443 tokenizer download| HF["Hugging Face Hub / ModelScope"]
    KVBlock -.->|optional RESP 6379| Redis["Redis / Valkey"]
    Telemetry -.->|OTLP/gRPC 4317 insecure| OTel["OpenTelemetry Collector"]

    style Indexer fill:#4a90e2
    style KVBlock fill:#4a90e2
